{
  "name": "Superior Fanged Aspect",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain one of the following features of your choice.</p><ul><li><strong>Killing Bite.</strong> If you hit a Prone creature with your natural weapons, you can immediately make another attack with them as a Bonus Action.</li><li><strong>Stronger Together.</strong> Allies within 20 feet of you also benefit from your Feral Resilience while you are not Unconscious.</li><li><strong>Feral Defiance.</strong> Your Ferocious Vitality recharges on a Short or a Long Rest and heals for 1x Shifter level additional hit points.</li></ul>",
